DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/browser-rendering/crawl/{job_id}
Cancels an ongoing crawl job by setting its status to cancelled and stopping all queued URLs.
Required: account_id (path) — Account ID.; job_id (path) — The ID of the crawl job to cancel.

DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/browser-rendering/devtools/browser/{session_id}
Closes an existing browser session.
Required: account_id (path) — Account ID.; session_id (path) — Browser session ID to close.

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/browser-rendering/devtools/browser/{session_id}/json/activate/{target_id}
Activates (brings to front) a specific browser target by its ID.
Required: session_id (path) — Browser session ID.; account_id (path) — Account ID.; target_id (path) — Target ID to activate.

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/browser-rendering/devtools/browser/{session_id}/json/close/{target_id}
Closes a specific browser target (tab, page, etc.) by its ID. Returns 'Target is closing' on success or an error if the target is not found.
Required: session_id (path) — Browser session ID.; account_id (path) — Account ID.; target_id (path) — Target ID to close.

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/browser-rendering/devtools/browser/{session_id}/json/list/{target_id}
Returns the debuggable target with the given ID.
Required: account_id (path) — Account ID.; session_id (path) — Browser session ID.; target_id (path) — Target ID.

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/browser-rendering/devtools/session/{session_id}
Get details for a specific browser session.
Required: account_id (path) — Account ID.; session_id (path) — Session ID.
